# Keeps frontend/public/ tracked while it holds no assets.
#
# git does not track empty directories. When the stock create-next-app SVGs were deleted this
# directory vanished from the tree, and `COPY --from=builder /app/public ./public` in
# frontend/Dockerfile then failed with "/app/public: not found" — which fails the frontend image,
# which fails `compose up --build`, which takes down ALL FIVE boot jobs at once.
#
# Delete this file only if the COPY in frontend/Dockerfile goes with it.
